# Written by the harness itself into whatever cwd a thread runs in — and this
# repo is one of its own projects. `materializeModelAllowlist` merges a
# profile's catalog into `.claude/settings.local.json` and records what it wrote
# in this manifest, so the sweep can take back only its own entries. Both are
# per-install runtime state: the manifest names one machine's gateway model ids,
# it is rewritten on every spawn and deleted again when no thread here needs it,
# and committing it means a diff on every thread that opens this repo.
.claude/.daedalus-models.json
.claude/settings.local.json
